 &lt;summary&gt;&lt;i class="fas fa-cat fa-lg pr2"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;Hi, I'm the here-bot cat!&lt;/summary&gt;
 &lt;p&gt;Use me to find your way in your website.&lt;/p&gt;
 
 &lt;dl class="f5 lh-copy"&gt;
 &lt;dt class="fw7"&gt;Here I am:&lt;/dt&gt;
 &lt;dd class="fw5 ml0"&gt;content/collection/day02/03-blogdown/index.md&lt;/dd&gt;
 &lt;/dl&gt;
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 &lt;p&gt;&lt;i class="far fa-trash-alt pr2"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;To remove me, delete this line inside that file: &lt;code&gt;{{&amp;lt; here &amp;gt;}}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
 
